    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4O-MINI"
        },
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a professional customer support assistant.\n\nAnalyze the message below and return ONLY JSON.\n\nCustomer Name:\n{{ $json.Name }}\n\nMessage:\n{{ $json.Message }}\n\nTasks:\n1. Determine sentiment (positive, neutral, negative)\n2. Categorize the issue (technical, billing, feedback)\n3. Assign priority (low, medium, high)\n4. Generate a professional, empathetic, and personalized response\n\nResponse guidelines:\n- Address the customer by their first name\n- Be empathetic and human, not robotic\n- Clearly acknowledge the issue\n- Reassure the customer it will be resolved\n- Keep it concise and professional (3–5 sentences max)\n\nFormatting rules:\n- Write the response as properly formatted paragraphs\n- Do NOT insert line breaks in the middle of sentences\n- Use 1–2 paragraphs only\n- Use a blank line between paragraphs\n\nReturn format:\n{\n  \"sentiment\": \"\",\n  \"category\": \"\",\n  \"priority\": \"\",\n  \"response\": \"\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        208,
        0
      ],
      "id": "094b61fd-255c-4739-b17a-250cb1da006b",
      "name": "AI Ticket Analyzer (LLM)",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "7dZiSgWjO23zKJvV",
          "name": "n8n free OpenAI API credits"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Get raw AI response\nconst raw = $input.first().json.output[0].content[0].text;\n\n// Parse AI JSON\nlet aiData;\n\ntry {\n  aiData = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch (e) {\n  aiData = {\n    sentiment: \"unknown\",\n    category: \"general\",\n    priority: \"low\",\n    response: \"We received your request and will get back to you shortly.\"\n  };\n}\n\n// Clean response formatting\nif (aiData.response) {\n  aiData.response = aiData.response\n    .replace(/\\n+/g, ' ')     // remove line breaks inside sentences\n    .replace(/\\s+/g, ' ')     // normalize spacing\n    .trim();\n}\n\n// Get original form data\nconst original = $input.first().json;\n\n// Extract first name\nconst name = original.Name || \"\";\nconst firstName = name.trim().split(/\\s+/)[0];\n\n// Create ticket ID + timestamp\nconst ticket_id = \"TICKET-\" + Date.now().toString().slice(-6);\nconst timestamp = new Date().toISOString();\n\n// Merge everything\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ...original,\n      ...aiData,\n      first_name: firstName,\n      ticket_id,\n      timestamp,\n      status:\n        aiData.priority === \"high\"\n          ? \"escalated\"\n          : aiData.priority === \"medium\"\n            ? \"pending\"\n            : \"closed\"\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
